{
  "job_B8.4.3.2_20251003_114848": {
    "chunk_text": "Her ys godspellys angyn H\u00e6lyndes Cristes Godes suna. Swa awriten is on \u00fe\u00e6s witegan bec Isaiam, nu ic asende minne engel beforan \u00feinre ansyne, Se Clypiende stefn on \u00feam westene gegearwia\u00f0 drihtnes weg, do\u00f0 rihte his si\u00f0as. Iohannes w\u00e6s on westene fulligende & bodiende d\u00e6dbote fulwiht on synna forgyfenesse. & to him ferde eall Iudeisc rice, & ealle Hierosolimaware, & w\u00e6ron fram him gefullode on Iordanes And Iohannes w\u00e6s gescryd mid oluendes h\u00e6rum, & fellen gyrdel w\u00e6s ymbe his lendenu, & g\u00e6rstapan & he bodude & cw\u00e6\u00f0, strengra cym\u00f0 \u00e6fter me, \u00fe\u00e6s ne eom ic wyr\u00f0e \u00fe\u00e6t ic his sceona \u00fewanga Ic fullige eow on w\u00e6tere, he eow fulla\u00f0 on halgum gaste. & on \u00f0am dagum com se H\u00e6lend fram Nazareth Galilee & w\u00e6s gefullod on Iordane fram Iohanne. & sona of \u00f0am w\u00e6tere he geseah opene heofonas, & haligne gast swa culfran astigende & on him & \u00fea w\u00e6s stefn of heofenum geworden, \u00feu eart min gelufoda sunu, on \u00fee ic gelicode. And sona gast hine on westen genydde. & he on westene w\u00e6s feowertig daga & feowertig nihta, & he w\u00e6s fram Satane gecostnod; & he mid Sy\u00f0\u00f0an Iohannes geseald w\u00e6s, com se H\u00e6lend on Galileam Godes rices, godspell bodigende. & \u00feus cwe\u00f0ende, witodlice tid is gefylled & heofena rice geneal\u00e6c\u00f0; Do\u00f0 d\u00e6dbote & gelyfa\u00fe \u00feam & \u00fea he",
